| **g. Request Validation** | If you ever accept input (query, body, params), use `express-validator`. | ```js\nconst {body, query, param, validationResult} = require('express-validator');\napp.post('/users',\n  body('email').isEmail(),\n  (req, res) => {\n    const errors = validationResult(req);\n    if (!errors.isEmpty()) return res.status(400).json(errors.array());\n    // …\n  }\n);\n``` |
| **h. Authentication/Authorization** | Add JWT or session middleware before protected routes. | ```js\nconst jwt = require('jsonwebtoken');\nconst authenticate = (req, res, next) => {\n  const token = req.headers.authorization?.split(' ')[1];\n  if (!token) return res.status(401).json({message: 'Missing token'});\n  jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET, (err, user) => {\n    if (err) return res.status(403).json({message: 'Invalid token'});\n    req.user = user;\n    next();\n  });\n};\n\napp.use('/users', authenticate, (req, res) => {\n  res.json([...]);\n});\n``` |
| **i. Just‑Authenticate / Basic** | If you’re only testing, a basic approach still helps. | `express-basic-auth` – quick demo. |
| **j. Logging & Monitoring** | Use `morgan` for request logs, `winston` or `bunyan` for structured logs, and log errors. | ```js\nconst morgan = require('morgan');\napp.use(morgan('combined'));\n``` |
| **k. Error Handling** | Centralized error handler to avoid leaking stack traces. | ```js\napp.use((err, req, res, next) => {\n  console.error(err.stack);\n  res.status(500).json({message: 'Internal Server Error'});\n});\n``` |
| **l. Dependency Auditing** | Run `npm audit` regularly, pin versions (`npm shrinkwrap`). | `npm audit fix --force` or manual review. |
| **m. Input Sanitization** | Use `xss-clean` or equivalent to strip HTML from user input. | ```js\nconst xss = require('xss-clean');\napp.use(xss());\n``` |
| **n. CSP Nonce / Strict‑Transport‑Security** | Already covered by `helmet`. |
| **o. Secure Cookie Flags** | If you set cookies, use `httpOnly`, `secure`, `sameSite`. | ```js\nres.cookie('token', token, {httpOnly: true, secure: true, sameSite: 'lax'});\n``` |
| **p. Avoid Hardcoded Secrets** | Move secrets to `.env`, load with `dotenv`. | ```js\nrequire('dotenv').config();\n``` |

