| Item | Done? | How to validate |
|------|-------|-----------------|
| **No secrets in code** | ✅ | `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard .env` should return nothing |
| **Secrets manager in use** | ❌ | `npm ls @aws-sdk/client-secrets-manager` (or GCP/Azure equivalent). |
| **Secrets are cached** | ✅ | Check `secrets.js` for in‑memory cache or memoization. |
| **No `.env` in repo** | ✅ | Run `git check-ignore -v .env` – should match the rule. |
| **IAM role minimal** | ❌ | Review AWS IAM policies for the deployment role – only `secrets:GetSecretValue` on specific ARNs. |
| **Secrets rotate** | ❌ | Enable automatic rotation in Secrets Manager console. |
| **Revoked stale secrets** | ❌ | Periodically audit. |

