| ✅ | Item |
|----|------|
| ✅ | **Avoid hard‑coding** credentials in source. |
| ✅ | **Use runtime config**: env vars, Parameter Store, Secret Manager, etc. |
| ✅ | **Fail fast**: throw an error early if a required secret is missing. |
| ✅ | **Least privilege**: give your deployment identity (IAM role, service account) only the secrets it actually needs. |
| ✅ | **Audit**: keep an inventory of who can read which secrets. |
| ✅ | **Wrap access**: share a small secret‑loader module so that all accesses are logged and centralised. |

