## Patch‑It‑Fast Demo

Below is a compact, fully‑working replacement for `app.js`.  Keep the same endpoints but add the strictest security defaults you can.

```js
// app.js
// ==== SECURITY‑FORTIFIED ====
//    1. Remove X‑Powered‑By
//    2. Add Helmet (CSP, X‑XSS‑Protection, etc.)
//    3. Enable strict CORS policy
//    4. Rate‑limit all requests
//    5. Lightweight JWT auth (for demo)
//    6. Environment‑driven port & logging

const express = require('express');
const helmet = require('helmet');
const cors = require('cors');
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');
const morgan = require('morgan');
const jwt = require('jsonwebtoken');

const app = express();

// ---------- 1. Security headers ----------
app.disable('x-powered-by'); // Hide the stack
